  A10-A11 → PUAF fallback (pending port), anything else refuses cleanly.
EOF
            ;;
        exploits)
            cat <<'EOF'
exploits — the technique matrix (K1.5).
  One table of every exploit path this project knows about: DarkSword
  pe_v1/pe_v2 (implemented), kfd PUAF variants (planned, K1.6), checkm8
