            ;;
        fuzz)
            cat <<'EOF'
fuzz — the ImageIO fuzzing harness (K4.2).
  Full pipeline (no args): prepare → push → run → collect → report.
  prepare  — research/imageio_mutate.py mutates DNG/HEIF/TIFF/JPEG seeds
